{"id":47314,"ord":26,"n_segments":152,"prev":47313,"next":47315,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Spirits of Rhythm and the road in the 1930s","title":"Original members and replacing Buddy Blurton","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"The original Nephews were Leo Watson, Doug Daniels, Virgil Scoggins and Buddy Blurton, all from St. Louis; Bunn took tiple player Buddy's place and stayed with Bernie about six months.","period":"early 1930s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1933,"words":388,"start":[39,10],"end":[43,0],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125#s47314","tags":{"places":[{"name":"St. Louis","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Kansas City","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"New York","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[{"name":"Hickory House","focus":1,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Ben Bernie's Sepia Nephews","focus":1,"leader":"Ben Bernie"},{"name":"Ben Bernie Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Ben Bernie"},{"name":"Teddy Bunn trio","focus":0,"leader":"Teddy Bunn"}]},"people":[{"name":"Buddy Blurton","qid":null,"n":17},{"name":"Leo Watson","qid":"Q225629","n":6},{"name":"Ben Bernie","qid":"Q816444","n":4},{"name":"Doug Daniels","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Virgil Scoggins","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Nephews","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Leroy","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":34,"theme_name":"Who was in the band: naming sidemen and personnel","community":39,"community_name":"Battling at the Savoy Ballroom","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":39,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see. Well, who was the original Nephews."},{"p":39,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":39,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"The original Nephews."},{"p":39,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"The original Ben Burnie's Nephews?"},{"p":39,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, right."},{"p":39,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Leo Watson."},{"p":39,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Leo Watson."},{"p":39,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Doug Daniels."},{"p":39,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":39,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And Virgil Scoggins."},{"p":39,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Right. So -- and not Doug's brother, though."},{"p":40,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Buddy. Buddy. I took Buddy's place."},{"p":40,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see. Buddy who?"},{"p":40,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"What the heck was Buddy's name? He was in --"},{"p":40,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"This was another guitarist."},{"p":40,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":40,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":40,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He lived in -- Kansas City? No. Yeah, Kansas City. They're all out of Kansas City."},{"p":40,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. So these guys were all coming into town to try and make it in New York at that time."},{"p":40,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"St. Louis. That's where they're from."},{"p":40,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, they're from St. Louis."},{"p":40,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":40,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But they came to New York, right?"},{"p":40,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"They came to New York."},{"p":40,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Looking for work."},{"p":40,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. We came -- let's see. They came to New York and I was in the Hickory House."},{"p":40,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. With your trio, probably."},{"p":40,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Uh-huh."},{"p":40,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And they wanted you to take the place of Buddy."},{"p":40,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's right."},{"p":40,"b":19,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So then it was like Ben Burnie's Sepia Nephews was -- it was Virgil Scoggins --"},{"p":41,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Virgil Scoggins."},{"p":41,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Doug Daniels."},{"p":41,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And Leo Watson."},{"p":41,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Leo Watson."},{"p":41,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And Buddy Blurton."},{"p":41,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Buddy Burton?"},{"p":41,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Blurt."},{"p":41,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Buddy Blurt."},{"p":41,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Blurton."},{"p":41,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Blurton. Buddy Blurton."},{"p":41,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":41,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And you took Buddy Blurton's place."},{"p":41,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I took Buddy Blurton's place."},{"p":41,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So there was only four of you initially."},{"p":41,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Right. We changed it from three to four and two, you know, one."},{"p":41,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see. Yeah. Right. Whatever."},{"p":41,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":41,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And then how long did you play with Ben Byrne's show?"},{"p":41,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I was with Ben Byrne --"},{"p":41,"b":19,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Six months, a year?"},{"p":41,"b":20,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Oh, about six months."},{"p":41,"b":21,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. And you were getting popular."},{"p":42,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":42,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You were getting popular?"},{"p":42,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":42,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"People liked it."},{"p":42,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":42,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Where was Leo from?"},{"p":42,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":42,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Where was Leo from?"},{"p":42,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"From St. Louis."},{"p":42,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"From St. Louis, also, huh?"},{"p":42,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. In fact all of them was from St. Louis."},{"p":42,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see."},{"p":42,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Except me."},{"p":42,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"What happened to Buddy?"},{"p":42,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Buddy passed."},{"p":42,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, I see."},{"p":42,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":42,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So then --"},{"p":42,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Buddy played the tipple."},{"p":42,"b":19,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, I see. Right. They didn't have a six string until they hired you."},{"p":42,"b":20,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No. When they got rid of Buddy I took it."},{"p":42,"b":21,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":42,"b":22,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Because Buddy couldn't make it, you know."},{"p":43,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And they was kind of fed up with Buddy anyway, because Buddy used to goof off, you know. To me he was an awful nice boy. Leroy?"}]}